    "subject": "Re: TRAVEL CLAIM: PENDING DOCUMENTS | NUR AMEERA BINTI ZAINUDDIN - PU557731",
    "body": "WARNING! This is an email from an external party. Do not click on any\r\nlink or open any attachment if you cannot ascertain that it is safe.\r\n\r\nAMARAN! E-mel ini dihantar oleh pihak luar. Jika anda tidak pasti akan\r\nkesahihan dan keselamatan kandungannya, jangan klik pautan (link)\r\nataupun membuka lampiran (attachment) dari e-mel ini.\r\nGreetings,\r\n\r\n Please review back the document. My flight is CANCEL not delayed.\r\n\r\nPlease find below the requested information and supporting documents\r\nregarding our travel claim.\r\n\r\n1. Confirmation on Trip Proceeding\r\n\r\nYes, we proceeded with the trip to Jeju as scheduled on 11 April 2026.\r\nOur original return flight from Jeju (CJU) to Seoul Gimpo (GMP) was Air\r\nSeoul flight RS908 on 14 April 2026 at 20:50.\r\nHowever, upon arriving in Jeju on 11 April 2026, we discovered that the\r\nAir Seoul flight (14 April 2026) had been cancelled due to airline\r\noperational issues/aircraft maintenance. We also received the\r\ncancellation notification email from the airline on the same day.\r\nAs flights from Jeju back to Seoul were fully booked thereafter, we\r\nwere unable to return to Seoul according to our original itinerary.\r\nDue to this disruption, we had to rearrange our return journey and\r\npurchased replacement flight tickets from Jeju to Kuala Lumpur instead.\r\n\r\n2. Reason for Trip Cancellation / Disruption\r\n\r\nThe disruption was caused by the cancellation of Air Seoul flight RS908\r\n(CJU-GMP) by the airline.\r\nAs a result:\r\nOur original Seoul to Kuala Lumpur return flight ticket could not be\r\nutilized.\r\nWe incurred additional expenses to purchase alternative return flights\r\nfrom Jeju to Kuala Lumpur.\r\nSupporting Documents Attached\r\n\r\n3. Please find attached:\r\n\r\nAir Seoul flight cancellation notification email\r\nPhoto of Air Seoul flight suspension notice at Jeju Airport \r\nPhoto of flight ticket that has been CANCEL\r\nReplacement flight booking/receipt from Jeju to Kuala Lumpur\r\nPayment details of new flight ticket\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease let us know should you require any further information or\r\nadditional documents.\r\n\r\n\r\n<blob:applewebdata://8576e265-9c7a-4d22-b755-5186ae7e78e3/daaf5aa7-4e78-\r\n40ab-b42a-3dfe4a5f2877> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<blob:applewebdata://8576e265-9c7a-4d22-b755-5186ae7e78e3/38311e81-1ab4-\r\n4891-b5f6-da65be22c20e> \r\n\r\n\r\n<blob:applewebdata://8576e265-9c7a-4d22-b755-5186ae7e78e3/1f01a273-8dfd-\r\n49ec-9213-4167aee37b35>\r\n<blob:applewebdata://8576e265-9c7a-4d22-b755-5186ae7e78e3/7ee1d347-a57b-\r\n4948-a4d3-ea143051bd7f>\r\n<blob:applewebdata://8576e265-9c7a-4d22-b755-5186ae7e78e3/e4ec9f32-f7ee-\r\n4753-845b-b27ad515c279> \r\n\r\nRegards,  \r\nNur Ameera\r\n\r\n\r\n\tOn May 11, 2026, at 14:43, Etiqa MY Travel Claims Care\r\n<travelclaimscare@etiqa.com.my> wrote:\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t? \r\n\r\n\tDear Sir/Madam.\r\n\t\r\n\tGreetings.\r\n\t\r\n\tWe apologize for the delay in providing an update on the status\r\nof your claim.\r\n\t\r\n\tYour notification of travel claim has reference. Claim No:\r\nP9109228.\r\n\t\r\n\tPlease note that we are in the midst of finalizing your Trip\r\nCancellation claim.\r\n\t\r\n\tTo ",
