    "body": "From: Leo [mailto:leongkginswa@gmail.com] \r\nSent: Monday, May 4, 2026 2:04 PM\r\nTo: Etiqa MY Travel Claims Care <travelclaimscare@etiqa.com.my>\r\nCc: Poh Yeng <pohyeng122@gmail.com>\r\nSubject: Re: MAYBANK 2 PLATINUM CARDS TRAVEL INCONVENIENCE & PERSONAL\r\nACCIDENT INSURANCE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWARNING! This is an email from an external party. Do not click on any\r\nlink or open any attachment if you cannot ascertain that it is safe.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAMARAN! E-mel ini dihantar oleh pihak luar. Jika anda tidak pasti akan\r\nkesahihan dan keselamatan kandungannya, jangan klik pautan (link)\r\nataupun membuka lampiran (attachment) dari e-mel ini.\r\n\r\nAny update on this?\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOn Tue, Apr 28, 2026 at 1:06 PM Leo <leongkginswa@gmail.com\r\n<mailto:leongkginswa@gmail.com> > wrote:\r\n\r\n\tDear Claims Department,\r\n\r\n\tI would like to formally submit a travel insurance claim under\r\nmy Maybank 2 Platinum Cards Travel Insurance coverage for a flight delay\r\nthat occurred during my overseas return journey.\r\n\r\n\tI am the principal cardholder of Maybank 2 Platinum Cards, and\r\nthe air tickets for this trip were fully charged to my Maybank American\r\nExpress Card.\r\n\r\n\r\n\tCardholder Details\r\n\r\n\r\n\tName: NG KGIN SWA\r\n\r\n\r\n\tTravel Companion\r\n\r\n\r\n\tName: CHOY POH YENG\r\n\r\n\r\n\tFlight Details\r\n\r\n\r\n\tAirline: EVA Air\r\n\tFlight Number: BR217\r\n\tRoute: Taipei (Taiwan Taoyuan International Airport T2) to Kuala\r\nLumpur International Airport T1\r\n\tDate of Travel: 26 April 2026\r\n\r\n\r\n\tDelay Details\r\n\r\n\r\n\tOriginal Scheduled Departure Time: 06:30 AM\r\n\tUpdated Departure Time: 10:58 AM\r\n\tActual Delay Duration: Approximately 4 hours 28 minutes\r\n\r\n\tThe airline officially notified passengers of the revised\r\ndeparture timing, and I have attached the screenshot showing the updated\r\nschedule.\r\n\r\n\tAs this delay exceeded four (4) hours and occurred outside my\r\ncountry of residence, I understand that this incident may fall under the\r\nFlight Delay benefit of the Maybank 2 Platinum Cards Travel Insurance\r\npolicy.\r\n\r\n\tDue to the prolonged delay, additional expenses were incurred\r\nduring the waiting period and as a consequence of the revised arrival\r\ntiming. I respectfully request reimbursement of eligible expenses in\r\naccordance with the policy terms.\r\n\r\n\r\n\tSupporting Documents Attached\r\n\r\n\r\n\t1.      Flight booking itinerary\r\n\r\n\t2.      Flight delay notification screenshot\r\n\r\n\t3.      Proof of payment using Maybank American Express Card\r\n\r\n\t4.      Boarding pass / travel documents (if required)\r\n\r\n\t5.      Supporting receipts / transport records available upon\r\nrequest\r\n\r\n\tKindly review my claim and advise if any further documentation\r\nor claim form is required from my side.\r\n\r\n\tI would appreciate your assistance and look forward to your\r\nfavourable response.\r\n\r\n\tThank you.\r\n\r\n\tBest regards,\r\n\tNG KGIN SWA\r\n\tMaybank 2 Platinum Cards Cardholder\r\n\tMobile: [6012-4505727]\r\n\r\n________________________________\r\n\r\nThis message is intended only for the use of the person to whom it is\r\nexpressly addressed and for the purpose of the subject of this ema",
